<%# Add-a-note / log-a-communication for a person, loaded into the everyone feed's
    composers frame once a person is picked. Buttons + panels share one panel-toggle
    scope. On a person's own feed the buttons live in the header actions and the
    panels in the body (see index.html.erb), sharing the card-level panel-toggle.
    Locals: person, new_comment, new_notification, record_targets. %>
<div data-controller="panel-toggle">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-2">
    <%= render "comments_and_communications/add_buttons" %>
  </div>
  <%= render "comments_and_communications/composer_panels", person: person,
             new_comment: new_comment, new_notification: new_notification,
             record_targets: record_targets %>
</div>
